EXPLAIN SELECT count(*) FROM poc_t JOIN poc_heap USING (id);
                                       QUERY PLAN                                       
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 Aggregate  (cost=21.80..21.81 rows=1 width=8)
   ->  Gather Motion 2:1  (slice1; segments: 2)  (cost=21.75..21.79 rows=1 width=8)
         ->  Aggregate  (cost=21.75..21.76 rows=1 width=8)
               ->  Hash Join  (cost=4.25..21.50 rows=50 width=0)
                     Hash Cond: (poc_t.id = poc_heap.id)
                     ->  Temp Result Scan on poc_t  (cost=0.00..12.50 rows=500 width=4)
                     ->  Hash  (cost=3.00..3.00 rows=50 width=4)
                           ->  Seq Scan on poc_heap  (cost=0.00..3.00 rows=50 width=4)
 Optimizer: Postgres query optimizer
